&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://canhtran.github.io/data-guy-story-v2/pr-preview/pr-15/wiki/technologies/kafka/replication/"&gt;Sao chép dữ liệu trong Kafka&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://canhtran.github.io/data-guy-story-v2/pr-preview/pr-15/wiki/technologies/kafka/rebalancing/"&gt;Tái cân bằng trong Kafka&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://canhtran.github.io/data-guy-story-v2/pr-preview/pr-15/wiki/technologies/kafka/delivery-semantics/"&gt;Ngữ nghĩa chuyển giao trong Kafka&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://canhtran.github.io/data-guy-story-v2/pr-preview/pr-15/wiki/technologies/kafka/transactions/"&gt;Giao dịch trong Kafka&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Lộ trình liên quan&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="lộ-trình-liên-quan"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
